{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy and an old man stand in front a pond, waiting for a swan's song. Meanwhile, they talk about life, death, and the passage of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue-based short story about growing up, life expectations and dealing with regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 minutes of waiting for the swan's song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The title is not a typo! Find out why.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Art made by hand by Federico Castillo, nominated for Best Poster at the Rome Prisma Independent Film Awards 2024.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story written by Luis Le\u00f3n, nominated for the Digital Moment Award at AMAZE Festival 2024.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598860?t=1745382465","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3598860?t=1745382465","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/8b8d256f19e1f279c630a80d3cf3861578408788/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745382465","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598860/8b8d256f19e1f279c630a80d3cf3861578408788/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745382465","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boy and an old man stand in front a pond, waiting for a swan's song. Meanwhile, they talk about life, death, and the passage of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dialogue-based short story about growing up, life expectations and dealing with regret.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 minutes of waiting for the swan's song.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The title is not a typo! F